Z||000015||SKIDMARK||10-28-2001||08:02 PM||||A good friend of mine bought a nice little red coupe like yours that had sat in a guy's driveway for several months under some trees. I took him over there to pick it up and just as he got on the freeway, smoke came pooring out of the engine comp. vents. By the time he pulled over and got out, it was burning. His $500 car turned into a car-b-q. We put it out with my extinguisher but the wiring was cooked. Towed it to his house and he stripped it for a parts car. Too bad he didn't clean the leaves out of the engine compartment when he picked it up. It would have been a nice car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport||||reg||9
